Check the chat for:

- when the trip was first discussed;
- whether it was in a chat that included you;
- whether anyone asked who was available or invited others;
- whether the plan appears private, last-minute, or prearranged;
- any message from you that could reasonably have been read as unavailable.

Save the relevant timestamps and wording. Silence in a shared chat would confirm that no invitation appeared there, but not why. If there was no mention, use the direct message to Toby; if there was mention you missed, assess the exact wording before responding.
